    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: SBQQ__ContractedPrice__c records with both SBQQ__EffectiveDate__c and SBQQ__ExpirationDate__c null.
Why it matters: Contracted prices with no date constraints apply indefinitely and override standard pricing forever. Customers stay locked at an old negotiated rate well past when uplift should have kicked in — compounding revenue leakage.
Suppress a finding: when the dateless arrangement reflects a genuine evergreen contract clause.
Disable the detector: only when dateless contracted prices are by design. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
